  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A nearly grey photograph of a Manhattan street with a blank sign, skyscrapers, cafe tables, and seated faceless figures in a pedestrian plaza, signed 2023.",
    "description": "A portrait format digital piece on a photograph, bleached almost to grey, signed 2023 at lower right. A grey blank street sign on a pole dominates the upper left, with a scribbled tag and a red arrow sign below it. Stone and glass office buildings line both sides of the street receding to tall towers. In the middle distance a pedestrian plaza holds metal cafe tables and chairs, a black umbrella with a scribbled tag, and people with blank skin toned faces: a figure in a white shirt seated at centre with another beside it, a figure walking at left, a group standing at right. The pavement has faint rainbow streaks. A motorcycle sits at lower left.",
    "impression": "The most drained of the Scribble pictures, as if the colour had been left out in the sun. The blank sign at the top is the key: a city whose signs say nothing and whose people have no faces, both waiting to be written on. Quiet and a little melancholy.",
